{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>梁芷珮（Christy）在節目《南美潮什麼 2》的旅程愈來愈精彩！明晚（19日）播出的節目中，她將會登陸距離智利本土約3,700公里的神秘復活節島，不但以性感Tube Top造型踩單車環島遊，更會深入探討島上數百尊摩艾石像背後的驚人秘密，畫面極具衝擊性！</p><p>Christy直擊摩艾石像工場嚇呆</p><p>復活節島上遍佈數以百計的巨型摩艾石像，Christy親身到訪當年雕琢石像的工場遺址，當場被眼前的景象所震懾。據記錄，島上至今仍有379尊石像，重量由14噸至驚人的300噸不等，部分石像甚至仍嵌在岩壁中，處於未完成的狀態。面對如此浩大的工程，Christy不禁連番讚嘆古人的智慧與力量：「以前嘅人好勁」、「係咪好黐線」、「呢度好靚」。這些石像原來是當地島民為紀念已故部落領袖而建造，實質上亦是墓穴，充滿神秘色彩。</p><p>梁芷珮Tube Top踩單車環島遊</p><p>除了探索石像之謎，Christy亦以一身健康性感的打扮，穿上Tube Top搭配短裙，大曬古銅色肌膚及美好身段，選擇以踩單車的方式環島遊覽，感受這個面積約163平方公里、住有約8,000多名島民的島嶼風情。她更把握機會，前往最受遊客歡迎的「Ahu Tahai」遺址欣賞日落，該景點是少數無需導遊便可自行前往的地方，Christy在絕美日落下興奮自拍，盡顯旅遊達人的活力。節目中，她更會分享辨別真正古老雕琢與後期仿製摩艾石像的小貼士。</p><p>網民大讚健康性感：人靚景靚</p><p>節目預告片中Christy的性感造型及復活節島的神秘景色引起網民熱議。不少網民大讚Christy的健康美：「Tube Top look好正，健康又性感！」、「人靚景靚，呢集一定要睇！」亦有許多人對摩艾石像充滿好奇：「原來石像係墳墓，有啲心寒但又好想知多啲！」、「300噸重嘅石像，古人點樣搬㗎？」、「睇完好想即刻飛過去復活節島！」。</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/01_14266499266a83f5e3972f9.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/02_6466741826a83f5e6678a7.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/03_14881615496a83f5ea20e70.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/04_11888849816a83f5eddfbdc.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/05_6601826146a83f5f20e4c9.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/06_14314188716a83f5f64c630.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/07_11239465406a83f5fa391bf.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/08_12240231406a83f5fe15b07.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/09_4130895146a83f6018620c.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/10_7151783256a83f60520d29.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/11_4017024236a83f6087c9e2.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/12_1092896346a83f60cd5826.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/13_11558833986a83f61156954.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/14_14866569116a83f6163a8ce.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/15_17549701986a83f61b509a0.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/16_15803559446a83f62004347.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/17_1167330246a83f62420a6f.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/18_11580438036a83f627b59f9.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/19_16459918636a83f62b7fe9b.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/20_13745016616a83f62f5b27b.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/21_20058781956a83f6338bd4b.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/22_6618476076a83f6379790a.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/23_15203741796a83f63b68f58.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/24_13074803306a83f63fc804b.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/25a_829058656a83f643e5216.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/25_5845986696a83f64729c6f.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/26_8517334556a83f64b61f6c.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/27b_20406842776a83f64f193f1.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/27a_13649989146a83f652a6613.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/27_5553884456a83f65607c9e.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/28_7378952116a83f65982c39.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/29_4076133056a83f65d6e451.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/30_10838132466a83f661356c5.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/31_6105264666a83f664c7afb.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/32_19808887236a83f667e8aaf.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/33_19015446656a83f66c0a2e7.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/34_16824159106a83f66f6e346.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/35_6505117476a83f67356a72.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/36_2331263756a83f677f15b5.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/37_6122143136a83f67c212ab.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/39_4585931976a83f68001437.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/40_10006166046a83f6844b171.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/41_7365902136a83f688bc87d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/42_13165922646a83f7ba6df73.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/43_8624271386a83f7be23c30.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/44_19342044316a83f7c18cdfe.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/45_8064147346a83f7c56295f.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/46_4670610996a83f7cab95bc.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/47_543026296a83f7d26f60f.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>還有什麼演唱會消息？</p><p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇： 演唱會時間表及購票資訊 ，包括 MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排 、 容祖兒 、 鄭秀文 、 張學友 、 鄭中基 、 溫拿 、 羅志祥 等。</p><p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？</p><p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看 Netflix劇集 和 BL劇 最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些 室內好去處 室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇： 離島行程攻略 或是行山，這些 行山好去處 路線簡易，新手也適合。</p><p>Tags : tvb即時資訊 南美潮什麼2 復活節島 梁芷珮</p><p>圖片來源：TVB 資料或影片來源： 原文刊於新假期</p><p>Aug 18 2026</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-18T08:21:06.516629+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1194,"images":49,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none"}}